  "notes": "Lineage Piece is an anime action RPG from Prlz's Den, released on Roblox in December 2025. You level up by beating bandits, bosses and dungeons across different islands, and collect weapons, melee styles and races based on anime characters like Naruto, Yuta and Elysia. The level cap is 7000, and endgame modes such as the Abyssal Sea ask you to clear timed rooms.\n\nCodes give coins, gems and rerolls. Rerolls are the most valuable, since they let you try again for a better trait or race, and some races add over 25 percent damage. Every code has a minimum level, so higher-level players can claim more of them. New codes come with each update and like-goal, and the developers list them on the official Trello and in the Discord.",
